  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.RedisOASIS v2.0.2\n\nRedis OASIS Provider — high-performance in-memory key-value store for OASIS holons and avatars via StackExchange.Redis. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.1\n- Automate coordinated OASIS platform releases (7ed2053)\n- docs(packages): add missing NuGet guides and release setup sections (77c65ea)\n- feat(providers): add Redis, Memcached, KeyDB, OpenSearch, Algolia, Solr, ArangoDB, QuestDB, CouchDB, and Xata OASIS storage providers with full unit/integration/harness test suites (5b53a93)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- fix(packaging): explicitly include newly documented package readmes (5be30be)\n- fix(providers): make all storage providers conform to OASISStorageProviderBase and add them to the solution (19d7a05)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.RedisOASIS",
